# 🎮 KBC (Kaun Banega Crorepati) Game in Python

A terminal-based interactive trivia quiz game inspired by the popular television show *Kaun Banega Crorepati*. Test your general knowledge and win virtual prize money!

## 🚀 Features
* Multiple-choice questions (MCQs) with incremental prize levels.
* Interactive prompts for user answers.
* Instant feedback on correct and incorrect answers with final winning amounts.

## 📂 Project Structure
* `main.py` - Main Python script containing quiz questions and game logic
* `README.md` - Project documentation
